085 verify-shared-kv-tile: stage-1 tile override for the grouped target-verify kernel

The grouped verify kernel (081 / 082) takes its prefix tile from a per-head_dim table that
only lists 256 / 576 / 64; every other shape, Flint's 128-wide heads included, runs the
untuned default of 4 heads x 64 keys on 8 warps. SGLANG_VERIFY_SHARED_KV_TILE=
"BLOCK_H,BLOCK_N,num_warps" overrides the tile (unset / malformed = the table). Arithmetic
is unchanged; only the fp32 accumulation order moves (same error vs the fp32 reference).
A head_dim whose env tile overflows shared memory at compile time (a 256-key tile over a
bf16 KV) is remembered and keeps the table tile.
flint DFlash2, 8 x 128 x 8: spec cycle 14.45 -> 13.6 ms at 128K, 18.1 -> 16.4 ms at 241K,
11.5 -> 11.4 ms at 34K. Kernel alone (8 rows, e5m2): 574 -> 432 us per layer at 254K.
